# Threadbind Clique // Rip the Seams: "Destroy target tapped creature." (an Adventure instant, CR 715) The target must be tapped (CR 115.1, 701.8):
# Bot2's attacking Ornithopter is tapped and can be destroyed, its untapped twin cannot be targeted. The Clique is exiled on an
# adventure (CR 715.4) and Bot1 then casts it from exile on its turn as a 3/3 flier.

[Bot1 Deck]
Threadbind Clique
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Island
Island
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x18

